{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","text":"NSRange"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"range"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCoordinates:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"coords","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSUInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The range of vertices to replace. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"location","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field indicates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" being the first vertex, ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field indicates the number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices to replace.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"range"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this array is copied to the shape’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"coords"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coords"},{"text":" array to insert in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"place of the coordinates in ","type":"text"},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The sum of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’s length and this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"count must not exceed the number of items currently in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"count"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference"},{"text":" object, you must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"explicitly set the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","type":"reference"},{"text":" property in order for any style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is greater than the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effectively be inserted into the shape. On the other hand, if "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is less","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than the ","type":"text"},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field of ","type":"text"},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", some vertices will effectively be removed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRangeException"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-appendCoordinates:count:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:"]}],"metadata":{"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinat